[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10621.349, "timestamp": "02:57:01", "text": "所以，是的，我不会用这些话来烦扰你们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10625.269, "timestamp": "02:57:05", "text": "技术方面的内容。我会在9点之前完成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10629.19, "timestamp": "02:57:09", "text": "所以，最近大多数时候都是9点钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10632.71, "timestamp": "02:57:12", "text": "一直在做，呃，我们已经开始……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10635.67, "timestamp": "02:57:15", "text": "我们9点开始工作，对吧？是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10638.15, "timestamp": "02:57:18", "text": "我们将于9点继续。我们来聊聊吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10641.19, "timestamp": "02:57:21", "text": "关于昨天的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10642.87, "timestamp": "02:57:22", "text": "因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10645.83, "timestamp": "02:57:25", "text": "是的，我当时在分析自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10650.23, "timestamp": "02:57:30", "text": "昨天早上。所以昨天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10653.429, "timestamp": "02:57:33", "text": "我注意到的是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10658.469, "timestamp": "02:57:38", "text": "嗯，我是个大笨蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10660.71, "timestamp": "02:57:40", "text": "为什么？因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10663.67, "timestamp": "02:57:43", "text": "我几乎一言不发。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10677.19, "timestamp": "02:57:57", "text": "我想得到，我想，我想，我已经"}]